                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "006e6f62-a0a8-4c05-a02c-03091d15bd06",
                                "sense_id": "b71fb48b-0bd2-3755-8f76-142c8c2a5382",
                                "text": "Там ма́ло-пома́лу исче́зли и ру́сло ручья́, разбива́ясь на ве́ер, и до после́дней кра́йности ве́рная пу́тнику расти́тельность: ча́хлый саксау́л, чий, хво́йник.",
                                "translation": "We saw gradually disappear both the bed of the stream as it split and fanned out, and those plants that to the last remain faithful to travelers: stunted ammodendrons, lasiagrostis, and ephedras.",
                                "english": "We saw gradually disappear both the bed of the stream as it split and fanned out, and those plants that to the last remain faithful to travelers: stunted ammodendrons, lasiagrostis, and ephedras."
